  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/4ZzBJFuP4JOQ2WlTMOhDfJ03RbQEeUx0ZU09uyJnmkaJUb4gyLpIU5yFximVXEUuwt9aurRhwWzs0ZfSGWN8XZcKHaJdUR3owEGKqTTu4PCTn8wv3KF1a9FoSjhyavJYx5tgrDbU7Hh4WFjeNrbp3xbHzHpzYv8s5z4v3XeZr4DiyoEf20u2Ge8TLH5UvN3MFXuM1v02\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/277/34092687345e01d6939bcbef5dbe7ba6..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日はめーにゃちゃんとマジカルミライに行ってきたよ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/STBi6k61M25oMxaAAw7jXHTmN8YYTNbUI2FP6AX5C5DskIz8Bdxe7i3jG6TrBqbWGlIaEEORcNAQDTJJLS7yBIzHjq2WwktQW4jkvO2ruHb08o6cJCx4bBxUhOURlBB3vl9GhwYWOZLV3TqKE32hgKteDNVQWQe9FaJ14OsY3O80aus9RAnhAujRGGHjboyMGyeKtqny\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/277/1f0151dbeca241cddc5ec2748d157889..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">初音ミクは生きてたんだね</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">声出しライブが久しぶりだったから</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">一体感を感じて嬉しかった！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なんかさ、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">いい意味でボカロのオタクって</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">時が止まってるわ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">平成って感じがすごい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">何十個と同じ絵柄並べる</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">痛バも超可愛いけどさ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">自分の好きな絵柄の缶バッジだけを入れた</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">痛バをつくったり</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">色んな時代の法被着たり</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ミクへの愛情表現がたくさんあって</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">私はそれがとっても楽しかったな</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">初音ミクの歌声は本当に世界を救えるって</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">心から思えたなあ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">やっぱり、何年経っても 令和になっても</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">モニター越しでしか会えないのはちょっと寂しいけどね</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/D2TuWBYsG7x1ZWxUbcrg1qWNj78Z2uvjC6bI1LfVR6tpydzVzKsCWBsfhy69fzY4Q3Xb0Hojwq7Rb2FPgIu7O3Aqjntut5yatwNQwpPcm30Rz2oDpla2Gdl4JGaFkDwnpO3IJ4E0YmRjYgybUxzWJRTJXctrNNtWyY6soy6Zg9TNbDvz9nHsjqhTCQtovk63XsuRBn6e\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/277/5b63036057e9616ecff1ef95a8ae8aed..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
